Package: corei-os-server
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: COREI OS <noreply@coreeyegroup.github.io>
Depends: corei-os (= @VERSION@), corei-kafka (>= @KAFKA_VERSION@), postgresql (>= 16), postgresql-client
Homepage: https://github.com/coreeyegroup/corei-os
Description: COREI OS on one machine (PostgreSQL, Kafka and all services)
 Installs and wires together PostgreSQL, a single-node Kafka and COREI OS:
 creates the database with a generated password, applies migrations,
 declares the Kafka topics and starts every COREI service.
